  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2017-05-04",
   "text": "Discharge Student Loans in Bankruptcy Act of 2017\n This bill amends the federal bankruptcy code to permit a borrower to discharge in bankruptcy a nonprofit, government, or private student loan, or an obligation to repay an educational benefit, scholarship, or stipend."
  }
